.TH KEEPAWAY 1
.SH NAME
keepaway \- keep-away ball game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/keepaway
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I KeepAway
is a keep-away ball game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
The player is on the left of a pitched field, the AI on the right. Move with wasd or the arrows; space kicks toward the ball. Drive the ball into the far goal zone to score.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move player
.TP
.B space
Kick impulse toward ball
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/keepaway.b
